{"synopsis":"Yoo Hyeol, seorang pejuang kelas tiga yang dijuluki “chaos sword demon” karena penampilannya yang mengancam, menjalani kehidupan yang diliputi rumor palsu dan kesalahpahaman yang tak berkesudahan. Suatu hari, Seolhwa wanita yang pernah ia janjikan masa depannya muncul kembali di hadapannya, bukan lagi sosok lembut yang ia ingat, melainkan seorang ahli bela diri yang tangguh.\n\nSejak saat itu, namanya menjadi terjerat dengan kehidupan para pejuang yang tak terhitung jumlahnya, meningkatkan reputasinya yang sudah terkenal. Ketika “ketenaran” nya menyebar, Aliansi Murim, Sekte Iblis, dan bahkan istana kerajaan memperhatikannya.\n\n“Tidak, sungguh… itu semua hanya kesalahpahaman besar!”\n\nTapi bisakah dia meyakinkan dunia sebaliknya? Atau akankah dia secara tidak sengaja menjadi legenda yang tidak pernah dia inginkan?","alternative_title":"아마도 무적불패","author":"2Poet","artist":"2Poet","chapters":[{"number":"62","chapter":"62","slug":"ch_62","title":"Chapter 62","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"61","chapter":"61","slug":"ch_61","title":"Chapter 61","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"60","chapter":"60","slug":"ch_60","title":"Chapter 60","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"59","chapter":"59","slug":"ch_59","title":"Chapter 59","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"58","chapter":"58","slug":"ch_58","title":"Chapter 58","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"57","chapter":"57","slug":"ch_57","title":"Chapter 57","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"56","chapter":"56","slug":"ch_56","title":"Chapter 56","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"55","chapter":"55","slug":"ch_55","title":"Chapter 55","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"54","chapter":"54","slug":"ch_54","title":"Chapter 54","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"53","chapter":"53","slug":"ch_53","title":"Chapter 53","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"52","chapter":"52","slug":"ch_52","title":"Chapter 52","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"51","chapter":"51","slug":"ch_51","title":"Chapter 51","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"50","chapter":"50","slug":